arbaee'n ke sogwaaro alvida<br />
aaqri majlis hai yaaro alvida<br />
<br />
qaatema bil qair chehlum ka hua<br />
alvidaae ashk baaro alvida<br />
<br />
akbar o asghar ali ki zaameni<br />
naujawaano sheerqaaro alvida<br />
<br />
kehte the ganje shaheedaa'n par haram<br />
fatima zahra ke pyaaro alvida<br />
<br />
karbala ki qaak ko soumpa tumhei'n<br />
arshe aazam ke sitaaaro alvida<br />
<br />
qabr par beto'n ki zainab ne kaha<br />
maa watan jaati hai pyaaro alvida<br />
<br />
qabr se aawaz dete hai hussain<br />
le behen zainab sidhaaro alvida<br />
